{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Issue #146 指出，itsdangerous 以及 Flask、Starlette 等库会在 simplejson 已安装时优先导入 simplejson，否则回退到内置 json。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
          "quote": "itsdangerous and by extension flask, starlette, and others use simplejson if it's installed due to:\n\n```python\ntry:\n    import simplejson as json\nexcept ImportError:\n    import json\n```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #146 质疑是否还有理由使用 simplejson，并表示不知道有什么特性或兼容性理由。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
          "quote": "Is there still a reason to use simplejson? I don't know of a feature or compatibility reason."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #146 提到常见理由是性能更好，但认为至少 Python 3.6+、现代发行版（可能用 PGO/LTO 编译 Python）且 simplejson 已编译时并不成立。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
          "quote": "The reason I have seen mentioned is better performance. That is not the case with at least python3.6+ and a modern distribution (that probably compiled python with PGO and LTO) with simplejson compiled. See [these benchmarks](https://github.com/ijl/orjson#performance)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #146 还指出，在没有编译器的容器中安装 simplejson 会退化为纯 Python 实现，并称这是一个 footgun。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
          "quote": "If simplejson is installed in a container without a compiler, it falls back to running in pure Python. This is a footgun:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #146 的示例中，json.dumps 用时 17.4 ms，而 simplejson.dumps 用时 89.4 ms，显示后者更慢。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
          "quote": "In [3]: %timeit json.dumps(data)\n17.4 ms ± 1.14 ms per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 100 loops each)\n\nIn [4]: %timeit simplejson.dumps(data)\n89.4 ms ± 7.21 ms per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 10 loops each)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #146 的结论是最好直接使用 json。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
          "quote": "It seems preferable to just use json."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PR #152 的描述称该 PR 移除 simplejson、改用 Python 内置 json 模块，并把 itsdangerous.json 替换为使用时发出弃用警告的代理。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SourceDocument:2e45ef24ed30d85a8f52a07705fd79ca7373b085a9db0695f5e9ef752d4d9524",
          "quote": "Removes simplejson in favor of Python's built-in json module. Since `itsdangerous.json` would just be an alias for that module now, it's replaced with an proxy that raises a deprecation warning on use."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PR #152 的描述还称该 PR closes #146；这是 PR 的关闭声明，并非已证实的 Issue 关闭事件。",
